This repository is a throughline *source*: a requirements graph, not a program. It
re-expresses the Twelve-Factor App methodology as a grounded IDD graph so consuming
projects can compose it with throughline.

The Twelve-Factor App is authored by Adam Wiggins and contributors and published under
the Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 3.0 (CC BY-SA 3.0) license. The rule text
re-expressed here in items' `text`/`attrs.source_ref` is derived from that methodology
and remains the work of Adam Wiggins and its contributors; this repository claims no
ownership over that content and reproduces it for interoperability. See
https://12factor.net/ for the authoritative source.
